Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}捡钱啊牛逼牛逼你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.46,0:00:02.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}这套打法收徒弟都行
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.98,0:00:04.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}这是个完整的商业计划案了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.98,0:00:05.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}张老师你好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.74,0:00:06.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}初一你好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.26,0:00:07.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}看了你很多视频
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.36,0:00:08.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}我也是长了很多知识
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.88,0:00:09.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}然后我今天上来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.82,0:00:11.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}就是说想请教你两个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.10,0:00:12.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}我们这块是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.02,0:00:13.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}那个做AI短视频的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.36,0:00:15.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}就是做那个宠物搬砖
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.20,0:00:16.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}是打算做这个是吧
